    {
      "id": 903,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [60, 100],
      "size": [560, 760],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 45,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Lip sync: a talking video from a photo and audio with InfiniteTalk",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Lip sync: a talking video from a photo and audio with InfiniteTalk\n\nMakes a video of the person in your photo speaking your audio with the core WanInfiniteTalkToVideo node on Wan 2.1 I2V 14B in single-speaker mode, in up to 4 passes that each continue from the last frames of the one before, then trims the video to the length of the audio. Built from Comfy's template video_wan2_1_infinitetalk.\n\n## Models\n\n- [Wan2_1-I2V-14B-480p_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_KJ.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy_fp8_scaled/resolve/main/I2V/Wan2_1-I2V-14B-480p_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled_KJ.safetensors): Wan 2.1 I2V 14B 480P, fp8, Kijai's build, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P).\n- [lightx2v_I2V_14B_480p_cfg_step_distill_rank64_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Lightx2v/lightx2v_I2V_14B_480p_cfg_step_distill_rank64_bf16.safetensors): lightx2v Wan 2.1 I2V 480P step-distill LoRA, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P-StepDistill-CfgDistill-Lightx2v).\n- [wan2.1_infiniteTalk_single_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/model_patches/wan2.1_infiniteTalk_single_fp16.safetensors): InfiniteTalk single-speaker patch, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/MeiGen-AI/InfiniteTalk).\n- [wav2vec2-chinese-base_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/wav2vec2_safetensors/resolve/main/wav2vec2-chinese-base_fp16.safetensors): chinese-wav2vec2-base audio encoder, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/TencentGameMate/chinese-wav2vec2-base).\n- [umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors): umt5-xxl text encoder, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/google/umt5-xxl).\n- [Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors): Wan 2.1 VAE, Kijai's build, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
